{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20076","headline":"答韩愈李观别因献张徐州 · 孟郊","name":"答韩愈李观别因献张徐州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"富别愁在颜，贫别愁销骨。\n懒磨旧铜镜，畏见新白发。\n古树春无花，子规啼有血。\n离弦不堪听，一听四五绝。\n世途非一险，俗虑有千结。\n有客步大方，驱车独迷辙。\n故人韩与李，逸翰双皎洁。\n哀我摧折归，赠词纵横设。\n徐方国东枢，元戎天下杰。\n祢生投刺游，王粲吟诗谒。\n高情无遗照，朗抱开晓月。\n有土不埋冤，有雠皆爲雪。\n愿爲直草木，永向君地列。\n愿爲古琴瑟，永向君听发。\n欲识丈夫心，会将孤剑说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}